type: software
title: "steganographer"
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Daniel Ari
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6232-9096"
repository-code: "https://github.com/docxology/steganographer"
abstract: "Rust workspace for tamper-evident media — embeds BLAKE3 hashes, Ed25519 signatures, and visible QR watermarks into live video and audio via LSB, DCT, and spread-spectrum steganography. Crates for the core library, CLI, GStreamer and an Axum dashboard, with a test suite and real-time webcam verification."
